<svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 680 300" role="img" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="">
<title style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">Three distinct mathematical operations in colour correction</title>
<desc style="fill:rgb(0, 0, 0);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto">Shadows tint is an additive offset vector, white balance is a diagonal matrix where each channel scales independently with zero off diagonal terms, and camera calibration is a full three by three matrix where the off diagonal terms mix channels together.</desc>

<text x="105" y="34" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke:none;color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:auto">① 加法 · 偏移</text>
<path d="M60 60 L52 60 L52 150 L60 150" fill="none" stroke="#8a8880" stroke-width="1.5" style="fill:none;stroke:rgb(138, 136, 128);color:rgb(11, 11, 11);stroke-width:1.5px;stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:miter;opacity:1;font-family:&quot;Anthropic Sans&quot;, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:auto"/>
